# First Major Issue – Memory Leak

During long-form podcast processing:

Observed:

* Memory usage climbed toward 11–12 GB
* Memory was not released after chunk processing

Investigation showed:

Accumulated ASR chunk data remained resident.

Fixes implemented:

* Slimmer chunk metadata
* Explicit deletion of ASR chunk structures
* MPS cache clearing
* Immediate cleanup after LLM stage

Results:

Before:

11.8 GB RSS

After:

