# Chunking Investigation

Hypothesis:

Chunking was causing entity corruption.

Experiments:

30 second chunks
10 second chunks
No chunking

Results:

30s chunks:
WER ≈ 0.338

10s chunks:
WER ≈ 0.315

No chunking:
WER ≈ 0.59

Critical finding:

Removing chunking caused Whisper to lock onto English and lose multilingual transitions.

Conclusion:

Chunking is required.

