# VAD Investigation

Hypothesis:

Voice Activity Detection was harming quality.

Experiment:

No VAD
No Chunking
No Diarization

Result:

WER exploded to ~0.59.

Conclusion:

VAD was helping, not hurting.

---

# Speaker Diarization Investigation

Hypothesis:

PyAnnote diarization overhead was harming quality.

Result:

No evidence that diarization caused transcription errors.

Main effect:

Runtime overhead.

Conclusion:

Not a quality bottleneck.

