## 1. Character Filtering for Comparison

Currently, punctuation like periods (`.`), commas (`,`), hyphens (`-`), and quotes (`"`) cause mismatch flags in the word diff and increase the Word Error Rate (WER) if one transcript uses a compound word/punctuation and the other doesn't. 

